# Pelbu Suites rules

- No hardcoded menus/prices/hours in UI — CMS or seed data only
- Ops screens use Supabase Realtime (no refresh-to-see-updates)
- DB changes require migrations + RLS
- Public site: UX → UI → visual; follow `design/mockups/` and pelbu-design-system skill
- `template_id` 1 is Pelbu flagship
- Stack: Vercel, Supabase, Resend, CallMeBot, Cloudinary, PWA
